{
  "text": "module apbslave #(\n\tparameter\tC_APB_ADDR_WIDTH = 12,\n\tparameter\tC_APB_DATA_WIDTH = 32,\n\tlocalparam\tAW = C_APB_ADDR_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tDW = C_APB_DATA_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tAPBLSB = $clog2(C_APB_DATA_WIDTH)-3\n) (\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPCLK, PRESETn,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPSEL,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPENABLE,\n\toutput\treg\t\t\tPREADY,\n\tinput\twire\t[AW-1:0]\tPADDR,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPWRITE,\n\tinput\twire\t[DW-1:0]\tPWDATA,\n\tinput\twire\t[DW/8-1:0]\tPWSTRB,\n\tinput\twire\t[2:0]\t\tPPROT,\n\toutput\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tPRDATA,\n\toutput\twire\t\t\tPSLVERR\n);\n\n\treg\t[AW-1:0]\tADDR;\n\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tDATA;\n\treg\t\t\tWRITE;\n\treg\t\t\tREADY;\n\treg\t\t\tVALID;\n\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tADDR <= 0;\n\t\t\tDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\tWRITE <= 0;\n\t\t\tREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\tVALID <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\tend\n\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t// Slave is idle if PSEL is not asserted\n\t\t\tif (!PSEL) begin\n\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\tVALID <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t// Check for valid APB transaction\n\t\t\t\tif (PENABLE && PREADY) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Capture address and control signals\n\t\t\t\t\tADDR <= PADDR;\n\t\t\t\t\tWRITE <= PWRITE;\n\t\t\t\t\tDATA <= PWDATA;\n\t\t\t\t\tVALID <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Transaction not ready yet\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tVALID <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Read response generation\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= 0;\n\t\tend\n\t\telse begin\n\t\t\tif (VALID && !WRITE) begin\n\t\t\t\t// Simulate read data (in a real design, this would come from memory/register)\n\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= DATA;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Write response generation\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\tend\n\t\telse begin\n\t\t\tif (VALID && WRITE) begin\n\t\t\t\t// Simulate write data (in a real design, this would go to memory/register)\n\t\t\t\t// For this example, we assume all writes are valid\n\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\nendmodule<|im_end|>\n<|endoftext|>",
